283
00:22:46,900 --> 00:22:49,597
At the end of the day, this
is just one man's power.

284
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:55,640
So there's no reason to believe that I
can't stop it your friend speaks the truth.

285
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:56,760
Yes, let's go

