337
00:26:00,340 --> 00:26:01,237
You're the best.

338
00:26:01,320 --> 00:26:02,780
Hey, don't be lazy.

339
00:26:02,940 --> 00:26:04,037
We still need help.

340
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:07,708
If any of you've got muscle,
we'll accept you with open arms.

341
00:26:07,800 --> 00:26:08,630
Oh, gosh.

342
00:26:08,713 --> 00:26:10,040
