352
00:27:17,940 --> 00:27:20,080
I'm dead for it! Don't give up!

353
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:21,940
Put your backs into it!

354
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:28,640
I won't for lift!

355
00:27:39,520 --> 00:27:40,980
What's up?

356
00:27:41,620 --> 00:27:42,780
Push through!

357
00:27:45,600 --> 00:27:46,840
What's up?

358
00:27:48,060 --> 00:27:49,817
