Make those strings cry.

362
00:27:56,980 --> 00:27:58,220
Okay, push!

363
00:27:59,460 --> 00:28:00,290
Push!

364
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:05,560
All right, this is our
chance to show off. Yeah!

365
00:28:19,900 --> 00:28:22,000
