372
00:28:43,100 --> 00:28:45,394
We're never gonna make it at this rate!

373
00:28:45,780 --> 00:28:48,697
Four minutes remain until
Luffy can use his Haki again.

374
00:28:48,780 --> 00:28:49,610
Therefore,

375
00:28:49,800 --> 00:28:52,397
the other fighters in Dressrosa
must find a way to make up their

